{"slug":"geometry-football-and-the-world-cup-final","publishable":true,"draft":true,"wordCount":896,"referenceCount":1,"seoTerm":"geometry football cup final","findings":[{"severity":"warning","gate":"standards-cleared","code":"demand-lens-missing-h2","message":"A level-two heading should naturally signal the demand lens when the reporting supports it; exact keyword copy is not required."},{"severity":"warning","gate":"standards-cleared","code":"attention-preserve-modality","message":"surface \"Geometry, football and the World Cup final. Spain will face Argentina in the FIFA World Cup final this Sunday at MetLife Stadium in New Jersey. Both sides arrive unbeaten after seven matches: Argentina as the defending champions and Copa AmÃ©rica holders ranked first in the world, Spain as the reigning European champions ranked second.\" uses certainty language for interprets warrant"}],"kind":"producing-content.standards-review"}

